{"id":"absolut","lemma":"absolut","pos":"adv","rank":647,"glosses":["absolutely"],"ipa":"/ap.zoˈluːt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/17/De-absolut.ogg/De-absolut.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich bin absolut gegen den Plan.","en":"I'm dead set against the plan.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/484938","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"against"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"project"}]},{"text":"Sie müssen absolut still sein.","en":"You need to be absolutely silent.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"quiet, silent"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Darüber weiß ich absolut nichts.","en":"I know absolutely nothing about that.","words":[{"g":"above"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"nothing"}]},{"text":"Sie haben absolut recht.","en":"You're absolutely right.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},null,{"g":"right, right-hand"}]},{"text":"Das ist absolut unmöglich.","en":"That's absolutely impossible.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"impossibly"}]}]}